<title>SINGAPORE: Super Coffeemix suspends trading.</title>
<headline>Super Coffeemix suspends trading.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trading in Super Coffeemix Manufacturing Ltd was suspended shortly after the lunch break on Wednesday, dealers said.  </p>
<p>A stock exchange official said the company had requested suspension in the afternoon. Company officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>The shares were last traded at Singapore S$1.38, up four cents on 466,000 lots.</p>
<p>Dealers said the suspension could be related to its announcement of an acquisition of a canned drinks company on Tuesday.</p>
<p>There were also speculation of a share placement or a bonus issue.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
